{"id": "eb395131-3caa-468d-bc69-576106c99e89", "slug": "vortex-next-generation-performance-engine-2", "title": "Vortex — Next-Generation Performance Engine", "description": "Vortex Next Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Vortex — Next-Generation Performance Engine\"\ndescription: \"Vortex Next Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF5A00\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#FF7224\"\n  background: \"#080808\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Space Grotesk\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Space Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Space Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Vortex — Next-Generation Performance Engine\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 223; favorites: 17; remixes: 1.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, effect.\n## Overview\nVortex Next Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nVORTEX Architecture Engine Demo Systems Documentation System Active Deploy Engine Vortex DESIGNED FOR SUPREME COMPUTATIONAL VELOCITY. ROBUST ARCHITECTURE FOR REAL-TIME GRAPHICS, ADAPTIVE PIPELINES, AND HIGH-PRECISION RE…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Vortex; Animate with mathematical precision.; Shader Configurations; ARCHITECTURE INDEX; Engineered for visual supremacy.; Vector Pipelines.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF5A00, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #FF7224, background #080808, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Space Grotesk for display moments and Space Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use Space Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Vortex — Next-Generation Performance Engine</title>\n  \n  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  \n  <!-- Iconify Icons CDN -->\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  \n  <!-- Google Fonts: Space Grotesk for Headings, Space Mono for Monospace elements -->\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&amp;family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"bg-[#080808] text-white font-['Inter'] antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#ff5a00] selection:text-white\">\n\n  <!-- NAVIGATION HEADER -->\n  <header class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-full z-50 bg-[#080808]/80 backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-300\">\n    <!-- Futuristic scanning gradient border -->\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#ff5a00]/80 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(255,90,0,0.6)] animate-pulse\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-20 flex items-center justify-between relative\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 group\">\n        <!-- Exact Custom Pulse Logo -->\n        <svg class=\"h-7 w-auto text-[#ff5a00] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105 filter drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,90,0,0.5)]\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <rect x=\"1.5\" y=\"1.5\" width=\"97\" height=\"37\" rx=\"18.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect>\n          <path d=\"M 25 20 H 45 L 48 10 L 52 30 L 55 20 H 75\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-normal tracking-wide text-lg text-white\">VORTEX</span>\n      </a>\n\n      <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-normal text-neutral-400\">\n        <a href=\"#features\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors hover:drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(255,255,255,0.5)]\">Architecture</a>\n        <a href=\"#mesh-visualizer\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors hover:drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(255,255,255,0.5)]\">Engine Demo</a>\n        <a href=\"#showcase\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors hover:drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(255,255,255,0.5)]\">Systems</a>\n        <a href=\"#docs\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors hover:drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(255,255,255,0.5)]\">Documentation</a>\n      </nav>\n\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <!-- Replaced pseudo-elements with standard DOM gradient structure -->\n        <div class=\"relative rounded-full p-[1px] hidden sm:inline-flex items-center group\">\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ff5a00]/50 via-white/5 to-black/90 rounded-full pointer-events-none -z-10\"></div>\n          <a href=\"#mesh-visualizer\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-['Space_Mono'] bg-neutral-900/80 hover:bg-neutral-800 px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-all w-full h-full\">\n            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(16,185,129,0.8)]\"></span>\n            System Active\n          </a>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"#interactive-cta\" class=\"bg-[#ff5a00] hover:bg-[#ff7224] text-white font-normal text-sm px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,90,0,0.4)] flex items-center gap-2\">\n          Deploy Engine\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n  <section class=\"relative pt-24 pb-12 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n    <div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[16/10] md:aspect-[16/9] bg-[#ff5a00] rounded-none overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between p-6 md:p-12 shadow-2xl\">\n      \n      <!-- Matrices mapped via standard CSS mapping in JS -->\n      <div class=\"absolute inset-0 black-dot-matrix z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 w-20 h-40 white-dot-matrix z-20 pointer-events-none hidden sm:block\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute top-1/3 right-12 w-96 h-12 white-dot-matrix z-20 pointer-events-none hidden md:block\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/3 w-80 h-8 white-dot-matrix z-20 pointer-events-none hidden lg:block\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 left-12 w-72 h-8 white-dot-matrix z-20 pointer-events-none hidden md:block\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute bottom-16 right-24 w-12 h-36 white-dot-matrix z-20 pointer-events-none hidden sm:block\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"z-20 w-fit\">\n        <div class=\"border-[1.5px] border-black p-4 md:p-8 pr-12 md:pr-24 bg-transparent inline-block hero-blur-in\">\n          <h1 class=\"text-[5.5rem] sm:text-[8rem] md:text-[11rem] lg:text-[14rem] font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-medium text-white tracking-tight leading-[0.85] select-none\">\n            Vortex\n          </h1>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"z-20 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-end justify-between gap-6 mt-12\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-xl hero-fade-in-1\">\n          <p class=\"font-['Space_Mono'] text-xs sm:text-sm text-black font-medium leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-wider\">\n            DESIGNED FOR SUPREME COMPUTATIONAL VELOCITY. ROBUST ARCHITECTURE FOR REAL-TIME GRAPHICS, ADAPTIVE PIPELINES, AND HIGH-PRECISION RENDER CONTROLS.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hero-fade-in-2\">\n          <svg class=\"h-12 w-auto text-white\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n            <rect x=\"1.5\" y=\"1.5\" width=\"97\" height=\"37\" rx=\"18.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect>\n            <path d=\"M 25 20 H 45 L 48 10 L 52 30 L 55 20 H 75\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- WEBGL/MESH GRADIENT INTERACTIVE VISUALIZER -->\n  <section id=\"mesh-visualizer\" class=\"py-16 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto scroll-mt-20\">\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start\">\n      \n      <!-- Left: Descriptive UI -->\n      <div class=\"space-y-8 reveal-element\">\n        <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n          <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#ff5a00]/10 border border-[#ff5a00]/30 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-['Space_Mono'] text-[#ff5a00]\">\n            <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#ff5a00] animate-ping\"></span>\n            LIVE RENDER PIPELINE\n          </div>\n          <h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-normal tracking-tight text-white leading-tight animate-word-by-word\">\n            Animate with mathematical precision.\n          </h2>\n          <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n            Our real-time WebGL shader core generates high-definition fluid dynamics and organic mesh environments dynamically inside your browser viewport. No bloated assets. Pure math.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Right: Moved Settings Panel -->\n      <div class=\"reveal-element\">\n        <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden group\">\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ff5a00]/50 via-white/5 to-black/90 rounded-xl pointer-events-none -z-10\"></div>\n          <div class=\"bg-neutral-900/90 w-full h-full p-6 space-y-6 rounded-xl relative z-10 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-xs font-['Space_Mono'] text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:tuning-square-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-base text-[#ff5a00]\"></iconify-icon>\n              Shader Configurations\n            </h3>\n            \n            <!-- Control 1: Velocity Slider (Custom JS implementation to avoid style tags) -->\n            <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n              <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs font-['Space_Mono']\">\n                <span class=\"text-neutral-400\">Simulation Speed</span>\n                <span id=\"speed-val\" class=\"text-[#ff5a00]\">1.0x</span>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"custom-slider-container\" class=\"relative w-full h-1 bg-white/10 rounded-full cursor-pointer flex items-center\">\n                <div id=\"custom-slider-track\" class=\"absolute h-full bg-[#ff5a00] rounded-full pointer-events-none\" style=\"width: 23%;\"></div>\n                <div id=\"custom-slider-thumb\" class=\"absolute w-4 h-4 bg-[#ff5a00] rounded-full shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,90,0,0.5)] transform -translate-x-1/2 cursor-grab transition-transform hover:scale-125\" style=\"left: 23%;\"></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Control 2: Color Shift Toggle -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-2\">\n              <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-['Space_Mono'] text-neutral-300 block\">Pulse Distortion</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] text-neutral-500 block\">Injects dynamic noise waveforms</span>\n              </div>\n              <button id=\"distortion-toggle\" class=\"relative w-12 h-6 bg-neutral-800 rounded-full transition-colors duration-300 focus:outline-none\">\n                <span class=\"absolute top-1 left-1 bg-neutral-400 w-4 h-4 rounded-full transition-transform duration-300\" id=\"toggle-knob\"></span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Control 3: Custom Dropdown -->\n            <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n              <label class=\"text-xs font-['Space_Mono'] text-neutral-400 block\">Geometry Style</label>\n              <div class=\"relative\">\n                <select id=\"geometry-select\" class=\"w-full bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-800 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-xs font-['Space_Mono'] text-neutral-300 appearance-none focus:outline-none focus:border-[#ff5a00] cursor-pointer\">\n                  <option value=\"fluid\">Organic Fluid Mesh</option>\n                  <option value=\"sine\">Linear Sine Waves</option>\n                  <option value=\"grid\">Mathematical Dot Grid</option>\n                </select>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 right-3 flex items-center pointer-events-none text-neutral-500\">\n                  <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- FEATURES SECTION WITH PREMIUM BORDER GRADIENTS -->\n  <!-- Updated background to requested orange styling -->\n  <section id=\"features\" class=\"py-24 px-6 bg-[#ff5a00] border-t border-b border-orange-600 scroll-mt-20\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-2xl mb-16 space-y-4\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-['Space_Mono'] text-black uppercase tracking-widest reveal-element font-medium\">ARCHITECTURE INDEX</h3>\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-normal tracking-tight text-white animate-word-by-word\">\n          Engineered for visual supremacy.\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"text-white/90 text-sm reveal-element\">\n          Discover a suite of ultra-optimized vector layouts, grid mapping systems, and reactive frame-buffers built to meet next-generation production standards.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n        \n        <!-- Card 1 -->\n        <div class=\"relative rounded-xl p-[1px] group reveal-element\">\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-black via-black/20 to-black/80 rounded-xl pointer-events-none -z-10\"></div>\n          <div class=\"bg-neutral-950 w-full h-full p-8 rounded-xl space-y-6 hover:bg-neutral-900 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n              <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#ff5a00]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[#ff5a00]\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:graph-up-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n              </div>\n              <h4 class=\"text-lg font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-normal text-white group-hover:text-[#ff5a00] transition-colors\">Vector Pipelines</h4>\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">\n                Ultra-light vector pathways built directly inside the canvas buffer. Scale up infinitely without pixel loss or raster overhead.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-neutral-800/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-['Space_Mono'] text-neutral-500\">\n              <span>MODULE: V-01</span>\n              <span class=\"text-[#ff5a00]\">ACTIVE</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Card 2 -->\n        <div class=\"relative rounded-xl p-[1px] group reveal-element\">\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-black via-black/20 to-black/80 rounded-xl pointer-events-none -z-10\"></div>\n          <div class=\"bg-neutral-950 w-full h-full p-8 rounded-xl space-y-6 hover:bg-neutral-900 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n              <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-orange-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-orange-400\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n              </div>\n              <h4 class=\"text-lg font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-normal text-white group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors\">Frame-Buffer Blending</h4>\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">\n                Seamless alpha blends and customizable blending modes designed to merge layered vector assets with absolute mathematical perfection.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-neutral-800/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-['Space_Mono'] text-neutral-500\">\n              <span>MODULE: F-40</span>\n              <span class=\"text-[#ff5a00]\">ACTIVE</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Card 3 -->\n        <div class=\"relative rounded-xl p-[1px] group reveal-element\">\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-black via-black/20 to-black/80 rounded-xl pointer-events-none -z-10\"></div>\n          <div class=\"bg-neutral-950 w-full h-full p-8 rounded-xl space-y-6 hover:bg-neutral-900 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n              <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-yellow-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-yellow-500\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n              </div>\n              <h4 class=\"text-lg font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-normal text-white group-hover:text-yellow-500 transition-colors\">Hardened Sandboxing</h4>\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-xs leading-relaxed\">\n                Run custom user shaders inside highly secure sandboxed threads. Protect computing instances from malicious thread blocks.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-neutral-800/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-['Space_Mono'] text-neutral-500\">\n              <span>MODULE: S-99</span>\n              <span class=\"text-emerald-500\">VERIFIED</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- REVEAL HERO WITH AURA ASSET -->\n  <section id=\"showcase\" class=\"py-24 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto scroll-mt-20\">\n    <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl p-[1px] overflow-hidden group reveal-element\">\n      <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ff5a00]/50 via-white/5 to-black/90 pointer-events-none -z-10\"></div>\n      <div class=\"bg-neutral-900/90 w-full h-full rounded-2xl\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12\">\n          \n          <div class=\"p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-12\">\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n              <span class=\"text-xs font-['Space_Mono'] text-[#ff5a00] uppercase tracking-widest block\">System Asset Integrations</span>\n              <h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-normal tracking-tight text-white leading-tight animate-word-by-word\">\n                Symphony of colors, space, and speed.\n              </h2>\n              <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n                Vortex seamlessly loads, parses, and scales high-fidelity atmospheric textures. Watch how our dynamic rendering engine transforms abstract layouts into interactive playgrounds.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-6 border-t border-neutral-800/80\">\n              <div>\n                <span class=\"block text-2xl font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-normal text-white\">&lt; 14ms</span>\n                <span class=\"block text-[0.65rem] font-['Space_Mono'] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1\">Render Latency</span>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <span class=\"block text-2xl font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-normal text-white\">120 FPS</span>\n                <span class=\"block text-[0.65rem] font-['Space_Mono'] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1\">Sustained Refresh</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Aura Abstract Background Image -->\n          <div class=\"lg:col-span-6 relative min-h-[300px] lg:min-h-full overflow-hidden group-hover:rounded-r-2xl\">\n            <img src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779250433970-aa02f586-acb7-4da1-92e0-4cc8b6ceea24.png\" alt=\"Abstract Blue Wave with Orange Highlights\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover grayscale brightness-90 group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-700 ease-out\" data-element-src=\"https://wypspaektjjiccarxrgy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/generated-page-media/302e86e0-80d8-4ba5-82e8-004220675655/2026-05-20/1779250433970-aa02f586-acb7-4da1-92e0-4cc8b6ceea24.png\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-transparent to-transparent lg:bg-gradient-to-r lg:from-neutral-900/90 lg:to-transparent\"></div>\n            \n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 flex items-center justify-between bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md p-4 border border-white/5 rounded-lg\">\n              <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-['Space_Mono'] text-neutral-400 block uppercase\">CURRENT ENGINE PRESET</span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white block\">AURA_WAVE_E534</span>\n              </div>\n              <button class=\"bg-[#ff5a00] hover:bg-orange-600 text-white p-2.5 rounded-full transition-colors\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:refresh-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- INTERACTIVE CALL TO ACTION -->\n  <section id=\"interactive-cta\" class=\"relative py-32 px-6 overflow-hidden border-t border-neutral-900 bg-black\">\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 black-dot-matrix opacity-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute -top-48 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-[#ff5a00]/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-8 relative z-10 reveal-element\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-['Space_Mono'] text-[#ff5a00] uppercase tracking-widest inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-[#ff5a00]/5 border border-[#ff5a00]/10 rounded-full\">\n        GET STARTED TODAY\n      </span>\n      <h2 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-normal tracking-tight text-white leading-tight animate-word-by-word\">\n        Build with the visual speed of Vortex.\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-base max-w-xl mx-auto\">\n        Join engineering teams scaling